message: "If you use or reference this project in academic or professional work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PieceTable Editor — A High-Performance C++ Terminal Editor"
abstract: >
  A fully functional terminal text editor built from scratch in modern C++17.
  Demonstrates production-grade systems engineering across text storage (Piece Table),
  incremental line indexing, the Command pattern for undo/redo, Thompson NFA regex,
  stateless syntax highlighting, LCS-based diff, and lock-minimised background autosave.
